# Stock inputs and build output. All of it is reproducible from the mirror with
# ./fetch_pack_inputs.py, and none of it is small — committing a 4 MB bundle per
# pack would put the asset CDN in the git history. It is also game data, which
# this repository does not distribute: never commit bundles, textures, meshes,
# audio or screenshots of them.
manifest_stock.bin
android_extradata.bin
bundle_sizes.json
bisect/
pack-*/
*.orig
*.patched
*.invcap
out-bh/
bundle_hashes.json
out*/
*.bundle
*.resS
*_preview.png
pumpkin_src.png
